  "seoBody": "<p>quickler built a custom purchase order platform for Bosonic, with guided form entry, saved vendors and addresses, and line-item memory for faster repeat orders.</p><p>Approval routing by email, approver signature handling, branded PDF generation, and status tracking were added so the workflow could move from pending to approved or denied without disappearing into inboxes.</p><p>Paperless indexing links, history cloning, and setup automation were also integrated so new environments could start quickly with minimal manual steps.</p><p>Live demo: <a href=\"https://demo.lochross.com\">demo.lochross.com</a></p><h2>Bosonic is now the named proof point for the invoice and PO workflow.</h2><h3>The approver gets a clear decision email</h3><p>Instead of a vague forwarding chain, the approver gets a proper summary with the key details and one obvious next action.</p><p><strong>Vendor:</strong> North Star Lab Supplies Ltd. <strong>Bill to:</strong> Bosonic Ltd. <strong>Ship to:</strong> Bosonic Inc, Newark. <strong>Requested by:</strong> Samuel Snowden. <strong>Total:</strong> £1,248.00.</p><p>Items: Precision lab assembly kits (4), Instrument mounting fixtures (2). Illustrative Bosonic-flavoured demo content shown for proof of workflow shape.</p><h3>Named approvers, status, and clear document actions</h3><p>This is the operational shape quickler built into the Bosonic workflow: obvious ownership, proper status, generated PDFs, and a filing path people can trust.</p><p>PO-BOS-004, North Star Lab Supplies Ltd, Approved. Requested by Samuel Snowden. Approver Jack Shannon. Total £1,248.00. Document actions: PDF, Paperless, Clone.</p><h3>A finished PO PDF with Bosonic branding</h3><p>The output matters as much as the workflow. The system produces a clean finished document once the order has been checked and approved.</p><p>Document preview shown as workflow proof. <a href=\"/assets/docs/quickler-demo-po-shire.pdf\">Download example PDF</a>.</p><h2>Need faster reporting?</h2><p>Get in touch if your team has one repeated report or document workflow that should be much closer to done before the day is over.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section\">Contact</a></p>",
